.TH "intel_lid" "1" "2016-03-01" "igt-gpu-tools 2.5" "General Commands Manual"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
intel_lid \- Poll the values of different reports about laptop lid state
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBintel_lid\fP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBintel_lid\fP is a tool to poll ACPI and the BIOS scratch register\(aqs reporting
of laptop lid state. This can be used for debugging issues with laptop
modesetting for lid opening and closing.
.SH "گزارش باگ‌ها (REPORTING BUGS)"
.sp
Report bugs on fd.o GitLab: \%<https://\:gitlab\:.freedesktop\:.org/\:drm/\:igt-gpu-tools/\:-/\:issues>
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
IGT Developers <igt-dev@lists.freedesktop.org>
